          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ol><li>Sublimation imprinting does not allow for white imprints on non-white material. <br/></li><li>IF your design requires white, please order <strong>WHITE COVERS ONLY. </strong>For example: If you are ordering a waterproof (beige/silver material) cover and your logo includes a white color, you must order a white microfiber cover instead.<strong><br/></strong></li><li>Please keep in mind that colors printed on material other than white, may mix to change the final printed color. Since we cannot print white on non-white material, we cannot produce a white underlay to keep colors from mixing together.<br/><em>(Example: orange on beige may appear more brownish.)</em><br/></li><li>Dye Sublimation imprinting sometimes causes colors printed on white material to appear lighter than requested. We will always do our very best to match RGB colors as closely as possible.<br/></li><li>IMPRINT SIZES -- Please read the <strong>Important Printing Note </strong>section for each product size to determine the maximum imprint size for the cover you are ordering. <br/><br/></li></ol>",
